From e7aa7df6b1ce0795de78251561f3d638a3017821 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@local>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:22:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: rebuild navigation as sidebar + top bar with teal
 accent theme

- replace top-nav dropdown (layouts/navigation.blade.php) with fixed
  left sidebar (layouts/sidebar.blade.php) + top bar (layouts/topbar.blade.php)
- grouped nav sections keep existing role-gating (Pengaturan owner-only)
  and active-state logic, now with icons and teal-50/teal-700 active highlight
- mobile: off-canvas sidebar behind backdrop, hamburger toggle in top bar,
  own avatar dropdown; desktop: sidebar always visible, avatar dropdown in top bar
- top bar search input and notification bell are static placeholders only,
  no backend wired yet (open item)
- add [x-cloak] rule to app.css to prevent sidebar flash before Alpine hydrates
